OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening with some late hazy
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Remaining dry overnight
OL,8,Fwith clear spells at times, although
OL,9,Fcloud will increase later in the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA dry start with some
OL,12,Fbrightness or hazy sunshine. Cloud
OL,13,Fwill steadily thicken through the day,
OL,14,Fbringing a few outbreaks of light,
OL,15,Fpatchy rain during the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,18,Fchangeable and unsettled period with
OL,19,Fspells of rain or showers, some of
OL,20,Fwhich will likely be occasionally
OL,21,Fheavy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
